			],
			"Message": "Refactor: Clean up code by removing unnecessary whitespace and comments\n\n- Removed redundant whitespace in multiple files to improve code readability.\n- Consolidated comments for clarity and consistency.\n- Streamlined the handling of parameters and responses in various functions.\n- Enhanced the overall structure of the codebase for better maintainability.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
